## Architecture

Modular Monolith with Rails Engines.

```
engines/
  {{#each modules}}
  {{snakeCase this}}/                    # self-contained engine
    lib/{{snakeCase this}}/
      engine.rb                          # engine definition
    app/
      controllers/{{snakeCase this}}/
        {{snakeCase this}}s_controller.rb
      models/{{snakeCase this}}/
        {{snakeCase this}}.rb
      services/{{snakeCase this}}/
        {{snakeCase this}}_service.rb
      serializers/{{snakeCase this}}/
        {{snakeCase this}}_serializer.rb
    config/
      routes.rb                          # engine routes
    db/
      migrate/
        create_{{snakeCase this}}s.rb
  {{/each}}
```

Each engine is an isolated, self-contained module mounted in the main application's `config/routes.rb`.
